  <notes>
    Completed 2026-10-04. Full detail: projects/spaarkeai-word-add-in-r1/notes/091-todo-tab.md.
    Server: OfficeSearchService.cs's EntitySearchMeta gained an optional EmailField (Contact only,
    "emailaddress1"); selected in the SAME impersonated query, never added to the $filter predicate;
